          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================
       EXPLORE PUNE
       ================================================================ -->
  <section class="section explore-pune-section" id="explore-pune">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center" style="margin-bottom:3rem">
        <span class="section-label">Explore Pune</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading">The city beyond the conference</h2>
        <p class="section-subheading" style="margin:0 auto">Extend your trip and explore the "Oxford of the East", from historic forts to vibrant food streets and nature escapes in the Western Ghats.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="explore-pune-grid">
        <div class="card explore-pune-card">
          <div class="explore-pune-img-wrap">
            <img src="/dqor/shaniwar-wada.png" alt="Shaniwar Wada" loading="lazy" class="explore-pune-img" />
          </div>
          <div class="explore-pune-card-body">
            <span class="badge-pill" style="background:hsl(45 90% 50% / 0.15);color:hsl(35 80% 35%);border:1px solid hsl(45 80% 60% / 0.4)">Historical</span>
            <h4>Shaniwar Wada</h4>
            <p>The iconic 18th-century fortification and seat of the Peshwa rulers. A must-visit for history buffs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card explore-pune-card">
          <div class="explore-pune-img-wrap">
            <img src="/dqor/parvati-hills.png" alt="Parvati Hill" loading="lazy" class="explore-pune-img" />
          </div>
          <div class="explore-pune-card-body">
            <span class="badge-pill" style="background:hsl(150 60% 40% / 0.12);color:hsl(150 60% 30%);border:1px solid hsl(150 50% 50% / 0.4)">Nature</span>
            <h4>Parvati Hill</h4>
            <p>Climb 103 steps for panoramic views of Pune. The hilltop temple complex is a serene escape from the city.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card explore-pune-card">
          <div class="explore-pune-img-wrap">
            <img src="/dqor/pune-food.png" alt="Pune Food Tours" loading="lazy" class="explore-pune-img" />
          </div>
          <div class="explore-pune-card-body">
            <span class="badge-pill" style="background:hsl(20 90% 55% / 0.12);color:hsl(20 80% 35%);border:1px solid hsl(20 80% 60% / 0.4)">Food &amp; Culture</span>
            <h4>Pune Food Tours</h4>
            <p>Explore Pune's legendary street food scene, from misal pav to vada pav, with guided weekend food tours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card explore-pune-card">
          <div class="explore-pune-img-wrap">
            <img src="/dqor/weekend-treks.png" alt="Weekend Treks" loading="lazy" class="explore-pune-img" />
          </div>
          <div class="explore-pune-card-body">
            <span class="badge-pill" style="background:hsl(210 70% 50% / 0.12);color:hsl(210 60% 35%);border:1px solid hsl(210 60% 60% / 0.4)">Adventure</span>
            <h4>Weekend Treks</h4>
            <p>Sinhagad, Rajgad, and Lohagad forts offer exciting treks just 1–2 hours from the city center.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="explore-pune-also-visit">Also visit: <strong>Aga Khan Palace</strong> · <strong>Laxmi Road Shopping</strong> · <strong>Dagdusheth Halwai Ganpati</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

