          <div class="ticket-card-body">
            <p class="ticket-card-desc">A curated day through Maharashtra — forts, ghats, food trails, and the kind of conversations that only happen away from a desk. Requires a conference ticket.</p>
            <ul class="ticket-includes">
              <li class="ticket-check--retreat"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>Guided tour (Sinhagad / Lonavala)</li>
              <li class="ticket-check--retreat"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>Pune food trail</li>
              <li class="ticket-check--retreat"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>Transport included</li>
              <li class="ticket-check--retreat"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>Limited spots</li>
              <li class="ticket-check--retreat"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>Requires conference pass</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="ticket-card-footer">
            <div class="ticket-price">
              <span class="ticket-price-amount"><%= @explore_pass ? inr(@explore_pass.price_paise) : "₹2,000" %></span>
              <span class="ticket-price-note">· add on with your pass</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/tickets" class="btn btn-secondary" style="justify-content:center;border-color:var(--color-gold);color:hsl(35,65%,35%)">Add to Conference Pass</a>
            <a href="#explore-pune-day" class="btn btn-ghost" style="justify-content:center;color:var(--color-gold)">See what's planned →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
